            "eyebrow": "Bryntum Gantt",
            "heading": "The Fastest JS Gantt Chart",
            "body_html": "<p>Bryntum Gantt is a performance-optimized, fully customizable Gantt chart suite for your JavaScript, <a href=\"/products/react-gantt-chart/\">React</a>, <a href=\"/products/angular-gantt-chart/\">Angular</a>, and <a href=\"/products/vue-gantt-chart/\">Vue</a> applications.</p>",
            "body_text": "Bryntum Gantt is a performance-optimized, fully customizable Gantt chart suite for your JavaScript, React , Angular , and Vue applications.",
