        {
            "id": "block_3f15ff5b45b62a6f88bc0de39e399b5d",
            "type": "text-media",
            "modifiers": [
                "image",
                "reverse",
                "added-shadow"
            ],
            "heading": "Tools for Real-World Projects",
            "body_html": "<p>Bryntum Gantt is engineered to help you handle real-world complexity and simplify project planning through smart and intuitive tools:</p> <ul class=\"two-columns\"> <li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">See the rate of progress with an </span><a href=\"https://bryntum.com/products/gantt/examples/s-curve/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">S-curve</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></li> <li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Compare task durations across </span><a href=\"https://bryntum.com/products/gantt/examples/planned-percent-done/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">baselines and visualize completed percentages</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></li> <li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Identify </span><a href=\"https://bryntum.com/products/gantt/examples/criticalpaths/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">critical path</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">s to fast-track project completion.</span></li> <li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://bryntum.com/products/gantt/examples/conflicts/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Resolve</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> or </span><a href=\"https://bryntum.com/products/gantt/examples/postponed-conflicts/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">postpone</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> scheduling conflicts to maintain the integrity of your plan.</span></li> </ul>",
            "body_text": "Bryntum Gantt is engineered to help you handle real-world complexity and simplify project planning through smart and intuitive tools: See the rate of progress with an S-curve . Compare task durations across baselines and visualize completed percentages . Identify critical path s to fast-track project completion. Resolve or postpone scheduling conflicts to maintain the integrity of your plan.",
            "links": [
                {
                    "text": "S-curve",
                    "href": "https://bryntum.com/products/gantt/examples/s-curve/"
                },
                {
