            "heading": "Lightning Fast",
            "body_html": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Built with modern JavaScript (ES6+) for fast and efficient execution, Bryntum Gantt is a JavaScript component optimized for speed so teams can stay focused on planning:</span></p> <ul> <li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Easily handle </span><a href=\"https://bryntum.com/products/gantt/examples/bigdataset/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">large datasets</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> and advanced features.</span></li> <li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Keep interactions smooth and responsive using instant updates.</span></li> </ul>",
            "body_text": "Built with modern JavaScript (ES6+) for fast and efficient execution, Bryntum Gantt is a JavaScript component optimized for speed so teams can stay focused on planning: Easily handle large datasets and advanced features. Keep interactions smooth and responsive using instant updates.",
