            "type": "text-media",
            "modifiers": [
                "image",
                "reverse",
                "added-shadow"
            ],
            "heading": "Fully Flexible Customization",
            "body_html": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tailor the JavaScript Gantt chart to match your project’s look, feel, and workflow needs:</span></p> <ul> <li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Choose between </span><a href=\"https://bryntum.com/products/gantt/examples/theme/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">five themes</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, or </span><a href=\"https://bryntum.com/products/gantt/examples/custom-theme/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">create your own</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></li> <li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Customize taskbar </span><a href=\"https://bryntum.com/products/gantt/examples/taskstyles/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">styles</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, </span><a href=\"https://bryntum.com/products/gantt/examples/custom-rendering/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">content</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, and </span><a href=\"https://bryntum.com/products/gantt/examples/custom-taskbar/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">labels</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></li> <li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Add your own rich </span><a href=\"https://bryntum.com/products/gantt/examples/tooltips/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">custom tooltips</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></li> <li class=\"p1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Use a </span><a href=\"https://bryntum.com/products/gantt/examples/resourceassignment/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">custom assignment picker</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> for quick task delegation.</span></li> </ul>",
            "body_text": "Tailor the JavaScript Gantt chart to match your project’s look, feel, and workflow needs: Choose between five themes , or create your own . Customize taskbar styles , content , and labels . Add your own rich custom tooltips . Use a custom assignment picker for quick task delegation.",
