                    "kind": "video",
                    "src": "../assets/gantt/animated-redraw-big-dataset-3.mp4",
                    "src_original": "https://bryntum.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/animated-redraw-big-dataset-3.mp4"
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "block_492ed05bbe9a04fbfdaa3f90f6a12ed8",
            "type": "text-media",
            "modifiers": [
                "video-file",
                "white-section",
                "added-shadow"
            ],
            "heading": "Customizable Task Editor and Menu",
            "body_html": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The built-in </span><a href=\"https://bryntum.com/products/gantt/examples/taskeditor/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">task editor</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is made to be easily extended and customized in the JS Gantt chart. You can tailor it to fit your workflow perfectly:</span></p> <ul> <li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Change the visible fields</span></li> <li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Add your own custom tabs</span></li> <li aria-level=\"1\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><a href=\"https://bryntum.com/products/gantt/examples/taskmenu/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Adapt</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> or </span><a href=\"https://bryntum.com/products/gantt/examples/custom-taskmenu/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">replace</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> the right-click task menu.</span></li> <li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Customize the </span><a href=\"https://bryntum.com/products/gantt/examples/resourceassignment/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">resource picker</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></li> </ul>",
            "body_text": "The built-in task editor is made to be easily extended and customized in the JS Gantt chart. You can tailor it to fit your workflow perfectly: Change the visible fields Add your own custom tabs Adapt or replace the right-click task menu. Customize the resource picker .",
            "links": [
